Z||000000||Jackalrr||12-01-2000||04:16 PM||||What is the ideal size and model turbo charger to use in a Fiero V6, and what make, model, and year of car does it come on? I would like to try to find one on a car in a junk yard if possile. <P>Thanks,<BR>-Charlie<BR>-----<BR>jackalrr@cinci.rr.com||||reg||5
Z||000001||rogergarrison||12-01-2000||06:03 PM||||suggest you buy a complete kit. i have an AirResearch kit in mine, believe me youll need lots more than the turbo unit. mine will put out over 12 pnds boost, but i run normally with 4-5||||reg||1
Z||000002||RedOktober||12-04-2000||02:31 AM||||Roger, <BR> What kit do you have? is it the auto or manual? How long have u had it?.. Sorry for all of the questions.. <P>I have a Miller Woods kit with a IHI RHB5 turbo. It came with the kit. Also found on Mazda's to Ferrari's... not a good junk yard find. Better to buy a new rebuilt one with a warranty. <P>------------------<BR>86 SE V6 Auto Turbo Going 3.4 OHV "Red Oktober"<BR>86 2M4 5sp (Beater) "Blackie"<BR>87 GT "Blue Flame"||||reg||1
